Open Vanilla 0033: practice against a real player bot. A practice duel (u1) alone for
OpenVanilla.Duels.PracticeBot seconds gets a level 60 of a random class played by the bot AI: a character on
the bot AI's own accounts (RNDBOT*, never on the ladder), one per class, made the first time and kept
(duels_practice_bot). It logs in, gets the bot AI's gear, spells and talents the first time, fights only (no
wandering), says yes to the accept window, and logs out after the match. If none can come within 30 s, the
creature bot as before. OpenVanilla.Duels.PracticeBot.Player (default on; needs AiPlayerbot.Enabled, with no
random bots logging in). Also: a match that isn't accepted frees everyone in it, not only its tickets.

